      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HER TWELVE STEP (2) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish half a length away in second (24.65) behind Daintree Ron at this track. Well-placed to take this out. ROCKY ROSE (1) profiles well and boxed nicely for his debut. Expected to play a major role. CHEER CHEER (4) is overdue for a win after recording back to back placings, the latest jumping from this same box when a 2.5 lengths second (22.97) in a Maiden FIN at Warragul. Rates a key player. MINTER GEM (8) makes debut for the Robert Reinke kennel. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Expected to produce a bold debut.",
